+"""LED-07 (FX-EXEC2, 2026-09-13; AUDIT_EXEC 842bbffa): the LIVE anchors table is read as a per-anchor series only
+through `pilot_log.anchor_series`, which separates the two book eras, the halted runs and the capture-time stamp.
+
