+    carrying the sha256 of its verbatim source line; MANIFEST pins the projection sha). No state/, no venue. ***
+
+ASSERTED HERE:
+  [0] fixture integrity (projection sha, 257 rows).
+  [A] REAL ledger: 130 external-era rows, 127 internal; 12 external halted rows excluded; series = 118 traded slots,
+      one per nominal slot, sorted; missing slots = 08-25 16Z, 08-29 20Z, 09-02 00Z, 09-09 12Z; rebuild slots =
+      08-22 12Z, 08-26 20Z, 09-07 04Z, 09-10 00Z, 09-13 12Z; prev-unknown = the four slots after a missing one.
+      Every figure is ALSO re-derived here by an independent loop. ★ RED on ef60f85: no accessor exists; the only
+      series the old tree offers is the raw table (257 rows, halted targets and the internal era inside it).
+  [B] neighbour cells: duplicate slot (last by position wins, named); off-grid slot; halted-but-holding; previous
+      slot realized None/NaN ⇒ prev_unknown (never flat); nominal_ts as text; internal row with external_book None;
+      input rows are not mutated; empty input.
+  [C] in the external series anchor_ts − nominal is within 1,380..1,548 s (capture time, not the slot).
+
+NOT asserted: that downstream statistics are right — only that the series they are computed over is the traded one.
+Exit 0 = all pass.
+"""
+import copy
+import gzip
+import hashlib
+import json
+import os
+import sys
+import time
+
+HERE = os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))
